      "id": "claim_83e8cdf5740347f5a86f598c87b1444d",
      "statement": "The Brijio monorepo is organized into seven domains with these primary source roots: shared protocol at packages/shared, the WebSocket relay at servers/websocket, the MCP server at servers/mcp, browser extensions at clients/extensions/chrome and clients/extensions/safari, product framing at README.md and docs/project, security at docs/security, and docs/history at docs/architecture/decisions and docs/artifacts. A clients/extensions/firefox boundary is reserved but not implemented.",
