    {
      "id": "claim_43c137f4c8cd4e788be36906fd9f5ee2",
      "statement": "The shared package owns the canonical wire protocol and browser-agnostic logic with no browser API calls: protocol.ts defines the WebSocketEnvelope, BrijioRole, BrowserPresence, TabInfo and typed request/response payloads, while index.ts re-exports the protocol, page-context, page-content, page-reader, batch-handler, popup, bridge-settings, timers, logger, and the adapter-driven background-controller modules.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://packages/shared/README.md#L1-L20",
