    {
      "id": "claim_986341674f4d40c2b8dbe2319da79d4b",
      "statement": "The MCP server is the agent-facing surface over an HTTP transport with bearer-token auth and origin allowlisting; mcp-server.ts registers the tools, the current-page-context and current-page-content resources, skill resources, and the brijio-context prompt, while websocket-client.ts authenticates to the relay as role mcp and sends request envelopes with optional target. The server also ships a demo site under servers/mcp/demo and skill markdown under servers/mcp/skills.",
