    {
      "id": "claim_99cae379ac11458295747c44062f5492",
      "statement": "docs/project/CAPABILITY_MATRIX.md is the canonical product contract and single source of truth for capability names, support status, and intentional boundaries; extension READMEs, the MCP surface, and the roadmap should use the same capability names it defines, and it is updated first when capabilities change. ADRs under docs/architecture/decisions are required before implementing changes that introduce or alter a product capability, cross-package protocol, trust boundary, or routing/lifecycle semantics.",
